            <section ID="L79ffd9d4-f73d-488b-b9b6-7ce605bfa4c1">
               <id root="8d02f345-3f8c-48e9-8e3f-0ac1a14c6bcf"/>
               <code code="55105-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - PURPOSE SECTION"/>
               <title>PURPOSE:</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Boron Citrate – anti inflammatory,** Calcarea Phosphorica – bone &amp; joint pain,** Calcium Gluconate – increase calcium,** Chromium Picolinate – increase energy,** Cobalt Gluconate – trace mineral, **Copper Gluconate – copper deficiency,** Ferrum Sulphuricum – iron deficiency,** Kali Phosphoricum - fatigue,** Magnesium Gluconicum Dihydricum – blood sugar regulator,** Manganese Gluconate - energy,** Nickel Acetate – increase iron,** Potassium Gluconate – muscle cramping,** Selenium Dioxide – supports thyroid,** Sodium Gluconate – chelates iron &amp; calcium,** Vanadium Metallicum - fatigue,** Zincum Gluconicum – immune function**</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>**Claims based on traditional homeopathic practice, not accepted medical evidence. Not FDA evaluated.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250606"/>
            </section>
         </component>
